+  // Local patch; reapply when upgrading live555.
+  // Send the interleaved header and the RTP/RTCP payload as a single write.
+  // Stock live555 sends them as two writes and, if the second one only partly
+  // fits, falls back to a blocking "send()" with a 500ms timeout. That blocks
